      "weather": "Fine",
      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SUMMER DREAM (1) is a well performed dog and winner of 20 races who is worth forgiving after finishing out of the placings at Richmond (23.23). Has good early burn and is suited drawn on the inside. Tough to beat if on-song. SAMMY MY BOY (2) slotted in just off the lead from the wide draw last start and boxed on to finish third (17.80) at this track in a Mix 1/2/3 over 306m. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Well placed and gets his chance. BUSY MAN (3) is a sprinter who thrives over these shorter races. Kept coming to finish seventh over 306m at this track (18.03) latest in a NG. Form at the trip strong including 15 wins. Hard to knock his form from this box, unbeaten in three starts. Bold showing expected. HEAR NO GRIEF (7) is worth consideration.",
